      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b5c054dc6d8850ef3eef5ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "328332ead4eb2b04965c5e7bc8bc1cb1a891e480b4be2763ea388aa07bfa4e65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033eadfa105c555b108ed72e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然……",
      "source_fingerprint": "af04d9c604458aa08ae05c9c5659088f541ee90806eaecca26cb376471e3fd53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d037731a5d3ed68c413b9e1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天能拿到这个哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25506ff3398182fe6675ae1af2a7c7572ba92d34816289a0fb02420a4164780",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:812ff202505fc3704340700b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然内心很想努力，\r\n可是身体……唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca2166dd1662198696b62b81c89b98256ffe75deda7baa208bdfb1a5cd7be19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f05bb25f2f9e0408f5114351",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好、好的！稍微休息一下\r\n马上就过——咳咳……！\r\n咳咳咳！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ba361671a0ebcd5345c989e8de407327e5fe23e6524bbb2ed87f728e709ca56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22efa244068c8392b42d36d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精神满满！干劲MAX！\r\n无论何时何地都要让人\r\n感受到我的热情~~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8bd76da09d6c744ba773ed36301fd10f41d5ee64b59f09296a7e8680e1117a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b892b00ee4ddb53c927c918c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请告诉我，这份干劲\r\n该往何处释放吧！哦哦哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "750a1c96f946d755ebdb93f9d564865960167ff51d8e3acfdb020915f6fb566e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caff2e0f026d396856dc087e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精神满满的刚志什么都能做到！\r\n来吧，快告诉我今天的\r\n训练计划吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1734eda05deac8f91a7338bc7c9f7b7d2f5428caaed7a79c5bbce71d0f26d31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd9eecf1c143d872d7561b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头和肚子都不痛！\r\n尽情上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "866ec0b10b80c2a503aaf1b8e2f8db9156198df6ac0822074875530ee1affd59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e77d5be82ac131440e2b681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备完成。\r\n身心和护理用品也都万全！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af1df78d3469f7dce43c2a56a2a9c76eee3c685b9a4be1a309814fde75d42581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e767430392f0ce06462b90a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想变得像鲁道夫会长那样\r\n又强大又帅气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cc10afedfce8ed8415707a360f0a6d2f2003183cbdc04dd9eb23c0cea28508e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c114cf9fc2180ecfa3f1687e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "——哈秋。\r\n没、没问题的。\r\n跑起来寒冷就会消退了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1406622a1781f310524ab570e20262fbeabf3615f9dfd4d2f2a3d39586732a68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a041a1987f706056801ac15e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔咕……午饭还在胃里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "88e5099f7df77bba8aa69b243e9e0f88ff1831b4d5e47e07f12214a912f60a69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8cdcdc8d4782fff0d5bf972",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……奇怪？怎么看到有\r\n三个训练员……？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cc780bc82a267abe01d7a9bb4052d894f90078da812174297af339816f673a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ad2b4b6d8f9deb99195c2f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请稍等……\r\n我调整一下呼吸……唔呕……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d19686ea4296961114cf5b7222b742f2524a117e64b3dc580b0709516b2118e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c285d39ed3b383e5159fac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要赛跑吗，我会加——\r\n唔呕！……呜，我会想办法\r\n调整好状态的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32203351e04218975b385afdbb7f5012d19b885ebdd1ea854300636b615ea7ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d9b937b22fd5bc7d7cbebc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽、虽然很想努力……但是，\r\n身体有点摇摇晃晃，\r\n头也昏昏沉沉的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad8ccb0ba0f3784a3fa18a0118d89b0a9fdb958512cb2c26a78157b421968abe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7243f441df4a75ed6d2b38cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我比任何人都强！！\r\n是最强的刚志哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8d8335f359583a2e300e418dcbe3f56fcb9850765ec8adc590c80766e461123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c1f66075e683b7cc0895b84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体状况万全！！\r\n我会全力以赴的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac7b8e87fc6833bf08a445748976a61c56ccb7d4e413f89a9f4ab28657cb854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afc4c1e58a14430577c8964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想获胜的心情不会输给任何人！\r\n绝对要！获胜~~~~！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "289dc86e83b3e523cc0002d52a937f654e89bbff23e1610056b8614b2ffbf7a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d8efbdc717e2a05c0d0187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我来个绝杀！\r\n您就安心观战吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "301d44ceb18b721b1facd70d1743be336f7a4fb118f90795b7e37bd4a8f9c4d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05467df83693ad3716ab9b8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态绝佳！\r\n刘海都卷翘起来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "993bbdfef6791431e0874e9bf71679136a934a1d1ac88e68b3b5482f313b8736",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01e41b29dd48469048979cb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘶，哈——\r\n嗯，呼吸也调整好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ebf173308c1cf746a02e1c12181d854de06e76a1c2a9baf6700657534e0e7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c4719576c87f0f273639b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，没问题。\r\n应该能发挥出平常的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ff3cbf7ec445d5f8a141d61c26714a4fe4ca0bf123c575614ef174bb1ec10a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37ed12ed4f8945d8e8087615",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了今天一直都在努力。\r\n只管把成果都拿出来就好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11095113c4ee4d5e97f1a49e4c4169ea9c25e25a26c686181c71d3feb7af52ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df50b1a9120505979742c877",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支持着我的人们都在，\r\n我必须得全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7db6417cb8507d1e02f487a38b3114ca093d387267e586804025d76060cdadf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4712644eb746e4141a2c4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……气色很差？没有的事，\r\n我现在干劲十足！\r\n绝对没问题的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a7cc8df550f3d01a1f77980dfc2afe7e72f6790bb1b64f2042369faac62c115",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
